expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Build the extension's component (cargo build --release --target wasm32-wasip2)

Usage: specforge extension build [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the extension project
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
